<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
   <meta charset="UTF-8">
   <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
   <title>Verification Successful - LifeDrop</title>
   <style>
      body {
         font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
         background-color: #f4f7f6;
         margin: 0;
         padding: 20px;
      }
      .email-card {
         max-width: 450px;
         background: #ffffff;
         padding: 30px;
         margin: auto;
         border-radius: 10px;
         box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
         text-align: center;
      }
      .brand {
         font-size: 24px;
         font-weight: bold;
         color: #e63946;
         margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
      .brand span {
         color: #1d3557;
      }
      .success-icon {
         font-size: 50px;
         color: #2a9d8f;
         margin-bottom: 15px;
      }
      .title {
         font-size: 22px;
         font-weight: bold;
         color: #333333;
         margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
      .message {
         color: #555555;
         font-size: 15px;
         line-height: 1.6;
         margin-bottom: 25px;
      }
      .btn {
         display: inline-block;
         background-color: #e63946;
         color: white;
         text-decoration: none;
         padding: 12px 25px;
         border-radius: 6px;
         font-weight: bold;
         font-size: 14px;
         margin-bottom: 25px;
      }
      .footer {
         font-size: 12px;
         color: #aaaaaa;
         border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
         padding-top: 15px;
      }
   </style>
</head>
<body>
   <div class="email-card">
      <div class="brand">🩸 Life<span>Drop</span></div>

      <div class="success-icon">✅</div>

      <div class="title">Verification Successful!</div>

      <div class="message">
         Hello <strong><%= username %></strong>,<br>
         Your email has been successfully verified. Welcome to the LifeDrop community! You can now log in and connect with donors or request blood safely.
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
         &copy; 2026 LifeDrop. All rights reserved.
      </div>
   </div>
</body>
</html>